date that is even is 2. Therefore, the value of \\( n \\) must be \\( n = 2 \\).\n\nTo verify, let's check \\( 7122 \\):\n- The sum of the digits is \\( 7 + 1 + 2 + 2 = 12 \\), which is divisible by 3.\n- The last digit is 2, which is even.\n\nThus, \\( 7122 \\) is divisible by 18 and satisfies all the conditions. Therefore, the value of \\( n \\) is \\(\\boxed{2}\\).",
